        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "\n$y=m x+b$ \n\nslope m and y axis intercept b \nderivative of $y=a x^{n}+b$ with respect to x:\n\n$d y/d x=a\\;n\\;x^{(n-1)}$ \n\nBecause e b is a constant -- think of it as $b x^{0}--i t s$ \nderivative is $0b x^{-1}=0$ \n\nFor a straight line,$a=m{\\mathrm{a n d~}}n=1{\\mathrm{s o}}$ \n$\\mathsf{d y}/\\mathsf{d x}=m1~x^{(0)}$ or because $x^{0}=1$ \n\n$d y/d x=m$ \n\n",
          "block_bbox": [
